## Troubleshooting Checklist

| Issue | Check |
|-------|-------|
| Calls not arriving | Verify the DID was entered **without `+`** (e.g., `61285008007`) and the dispatch rule is linked to the Tronic inbound trunk |
| 401 / 407 on outbound | Verify Username and Password match exactly what Tronic Cloud emailed you — copy and paste, don't retype |
| Wrong number format error | Confirm **Number Format** is set to `no_plus` (not `+E.164`) on both inbound and outbound trunks |
| One-way audio | Ensure your dashboard server's firewall allows UDP/RTP ports for the 7 Tronic egress IPs and `use_external_ip: true` is set in `livekit-sip` config if behind NAT |
| No room created | Check dispatch rule is linked to the correct trunk ID |
| Outbound caller ID wrong | Verify the **Numbers** field on the outbound trunk matches your Tronic DID(s) |
| Need a new DID, billing question, account issue | Email **accounts@tronic.com.au** or **support@tronic.com.au** |

