## Quick Reference: Configuration Summary

**Tronic Cloud Side:**
```
Setup: email accounts@tronic.com.au

Issued by Tronic Cloud:
  → SIP Username
  → SIP Password
  → DID(s) in E.164 format

Authentication:
  → Inbound: IP whitelist (7 fixed Tronic egress IPs)
  → Outbound: digest (username + password)

Region: single global (voice.tronic.com.au)
```

**LiveKit Side:**
```
Inbound Trunk:
  → Name: Tronic Cloud Inbound
  → Number Format: no_plus
  → Trunk Type: pstn
  → Numbers: Your Tronic DID (no +)
  → Allowed Addresses: 7 Tronic egress IPs (auto-filled)
  → Auth: None (IP whitelist)

Dispatch Rule:
  → Linked to: Tronic Cloud Inbound trunk
  → Type: Individual (recommended)
  → Room Prefix: caller-
  → Agent: Your AI agent

Outbound Trunk:
  → Name: Tronic Cloud Outbound
  → Address: voice.tronic.com.au (auto-filled)
  → Transport: UDP
  → Number Format: no_plus
  → Trunk Type: pstn
  → Auth: Tronic SIP username + password
  → Numbers: Your Tronic DID (no +)
```

---

This guide covers the complete end-to-end setup for both inbound and outbound calls via Tronic Cloud — the recommended SIP trunk provider for the LiveKit Dashboard.
